WEBVTT

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.380
<i>None of us are junk to begin with.</i>

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>We all have the radiance making us
worthy of becoming Alice.</i>

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.140
<i>But you did come.</i>

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:05.630
Good evening, Miss Angel.

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:09.140
I've told you not to come here.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.150
I couldn't sleep.

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:13.370
And I want to discuss something.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.750
Today, my parents came.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.380
And they asked if it'd be okay
to hire someone to look after me.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:25.910
It wouldn't make a difference to me
if I had an attendant or not...

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:29.890
...but they both had such
apologetic looks on their faces.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:36.070
Seeing that, it made me think,
"Oh, it's all my fault."

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.100
So...

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.470
Use up my life soon.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.470
I don't need you to tell me that.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:49.330
I'll be counting on you.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:51.970
You're really okay?

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.830
For it to end like this?

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:57.480
It isn't like you to ask that.

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.440
It can't be helped.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.670
Because ever since I was born...

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.020
...I've been junk.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.670
Doll Maker

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.080
Thank you for the food!

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.340
Oh my.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:26.240
There's plenty, so you don't need to be
in such a hurry.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:29.640
Jeez, I've never seen 
such ill-mannered people.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.140
You're Rozen Maidens.
Show a little more refinement...

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:38.080
I finished eating first!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:38.900
Hina!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:39.620
Kana!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:40.950
Why you!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.030
Sit your asses down!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.530
Hold it right there!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.350
Honestly, what a racket.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.030
What are you doing?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.770
I'm taking the seeds out.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.470
How many seeds do you 
think are in there?

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:58.530
The sun will set before that.

00:03:58.530 --> 00:03:59.580
Be quiet.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.030
Nori, cut it a little smaller for me.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.210
All right.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.270
Damn those puny runts!
They'll pay for it someday!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.990
Souseiseki?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.920
Father...

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.240
Father!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.820
That was definitely...

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:34.000
Souseiseki, you were here?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.480
Perfect timing. 
Nori has watermelon...

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.440
Oh, sorry.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.880
I have something to take care of.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.750
I see.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.720
Suigintou is, huh?

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.770
Well, why don't you wait 
and see a little longer?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.270
You are going?

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:09.640
I've got my own thoughts, so...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.170
Hey! Sakurada-kun!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.880
Do you have time today?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:21.120
Why don't you come in and watch
Master Enju make dolls?

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.490
Is it okay?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:26.990
Observing?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.270
Yup. Sakurada-kun.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:32.220
I told you he's interested 
in dolls, right?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.470
He's always coming by the store,
so I want to let him watch.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.710
It's okay.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:00.880
Um...

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.780
Hold still.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.430
Okay.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.100
You pass.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.210
You can stay and watch.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.440
Isn't that great?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.450
Thank you very much.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.450
But it would be better if you
trimmed your hair a little more.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.950
Oh, okay.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.880
Your chair is here.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.340
O-Okay.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.030
What is your aim?

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:37.780
Hard to say...

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.030
But I hope it gets interesting.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:54.030
That's it for today.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.460
This will be fired overnight...

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:00.110
...cooled until morning,
then worked on tomorrow.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.660
Overnight?

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.560
Right.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.670
You'll fire it that long?

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.350
Bisque firing.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.850
It'll become this small afterwards.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.100
That small?

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.820
That's amazing.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.360
This one is a failure though.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.920
This is a failure?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.600
Yes.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.710
You may not be able to tell...

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.220
...but it's no good.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:32.110
I got it! We'll be fine now!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.530
Kun-kun, it's no use.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:37.610
Both the doors and windows are locked.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.610
Please take a good look!
 Over there!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.140
This is... Ants!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.120
That is right!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.430
Kun-kun's amazing!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:49.220
Amazing! Amazing!

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:55.540
To Kanaria, the brainiest Rozen Maiden,
deducing that would be cake, I guess?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.260
Kun-kun's more amazing!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.060
Kana is!

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:58.940
Kun-kun!

00:08:58.940 --> 00:08:59.870
You two!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:03.810
If you cannot watch 
quietly, go to Jun's room.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.910
Kun-kun, watch out!

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:10.360
Behind you!
 He's behind you!

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.200
Behind me?!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.760
Yes, that's right.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.110
He heard me.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.110
What is this?

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:22.120
Who is th-that woman?

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:26.630
Souseiseki, what are you
doing here at this hour?

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.580
Nothing.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.860
Did you fight with Gramps?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.600
That's not it.

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:37.170
Suiseiseki, I came to ask you
about how you feel.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:39.670
How I feel?

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:44.230
What will you do if 
the Alice Game begins?

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:47.020
Will you fight?

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.310
You bring it up so suddenly...

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.560
You'd better give it some thought.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.630
Oh, Souseiseki!

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.690
I'm back.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.560
Suiseiseki, what are you doing?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.180
What's wrong?

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.560
I-It's nothing...

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:09.980
W-What are you doing?

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.070
S-Stop this, you!

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:15.310
You guys are dolls, right?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.820
Jun?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.420
Good night.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.470
Night.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.750
Good night.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.600
Well then, I'm going to sleep too.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.600
Say...

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:39.660
How were you guys made?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.620
Well, this Rozen...

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.720
This Father of yours...

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.440
I was wondering what he's like.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.820
Rosa Mysticas...

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.240
You're...

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:08.560
This girl...

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.560
She can be saved with the Rosa Mysticas.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:15.560
It can't be...

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:22.900
With the power of the Rosa Mysticas,
it would be effortless.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.700
There is almost nothing
that I remember of Father.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:59.700
I only know the gentleness 
that enveloped me...

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:01.210
The comfort...

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.440
A veil protecting me from all things.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.660
The thoughts and warmth that came across
through his touch...

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.280
His calm gaze on me...

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.520
Even without anything,
everything was right there.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:16.760
Do you remember his face?

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:18.750
Only vaguely.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.680
What about Hina-Ichigo
and Suiseiseki and Souseiseki?

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.760
They are the same as me.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:29.010
They only remember that he
was a man bathed in warm light.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:32.350
But what he looks like
 does not matter.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:33.650
That's...

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:37.780
It is not his appearance
but his very existence that does.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:41.530
Transcending time,
 changing his appearance...

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:44.480
Father exists in every world...

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.970
In order to create Alice.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.440
Created in that endeavor
were the Rozen Maidens...

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:57.000
Dolls that aspired to but did not
become the ultimate girl, Alice.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.500
That is us.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.750
But that's...

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.920
Then what does Rozen 
think of you guys...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:08.200
You guys couldn't become Alice,
so what does he think of you?

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.010
That is...

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:15.750
You didn't measure up to being Alice,
so he expects you to fight?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.190
I don't understand that.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.460
Father!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:37.900
Father.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.840
Father?

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.670
Father!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.360
Father?

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.200
Are you crying?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.400
Father!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.920
Father...

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.330
You're...

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.390
Father is crying.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.900
That he cannot find Alice...

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:22.530
If things remain as they are,
Father will only continue to grieve.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:28.910
So that we may also fulfill
Father's wish, let us begin...

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.080
...the Alice Game.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:45.730
How did it go?

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.540
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.040
Everything is ready then, I suppose?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.630
<i>What does Rozen think of you guys...</i>

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:25.140
<i>You guys couldn't become Alice,
so what does he think of you?</i>

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.590
Um...

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:38.080
Does a doll ever turn out different
from what you had in mind?

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.230
It happens.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.550
What do you do at times like that?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:07.870
However...

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.940
The feeling is the same.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.910
All are equal.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:13.110
Equal?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.170
The feeling that fills a doll
 is equally the same.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.850
As long as you pour your love into her,
she'll continue to live.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:22.420
Love...

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:28.060
If the love vanishes, 
she will go away.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.300
She will become lost.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.860
That is true for all of them.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.010
Hello.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.480
Do you know 
of a doll maker called Rozen?

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:55.380
Yes.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.890
Do you think there was love in Rozen?

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:04.920
Without love, 
you can't make dolls.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.900
Especially not magnificent dolls.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:11.470
But Rozen went away...

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:15.900
...leaving behind seven dolls
that were unable to become Alice.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.940
Though he is apart, 
far away from them...

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.830
...the love remains.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.150
His love is being poured into them.

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:29.150
That's why...

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:38.570
Hina's number one!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.630
You're still a novice, I guess!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:42.420
Then let's have a race!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:41.870
What?

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.970
I accept, I guess?

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:43.760
Nothing.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.100
Shinku!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.770
Shinku!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.140
I'm having a shaved-ice
eating contest with Kana!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:52.010
We want you to time us, I guess?

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.580
That is just...

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.810
I am too astonished for words.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.240
It will make your head twinge.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.010
Twinge?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:01.330
What do you mean by that?

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.250
Oh, Souseiseki!

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.760
Oh, you had not gone home?

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:09.490
S-Souseiseki...

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.890
U-Um...

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.900
There's something I want 
to say to everyone.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.940
I thought I'd let you know in advance.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.860
Souseiseki...

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.180
I... am going to aim for Alice.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:43.820
I will fight you all,
 collect the Rosa Mysticas,

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:44.860
and become Alice.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.680
But...

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.510
Hold on, you!

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:51.160
Why are you
suddenly saying this?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:55.800
From the beginning,
it has been our destiny to fight.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.170
It's natural that this would happen.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.170
What happened?

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:04.250
Souseiseki!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.700
Father...

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.680
I saw Father.

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:14.160
Father is grieving.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.780
He is lamenting that 
he has not found Alice.

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:23.380
Our actions are deviating 
from Father's ideal.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.610
To save Father from his grief...

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.370
...one of us must become Alice.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.530
Shinku...

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:36.270
If that is what you are 
determined to do, I...

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:37.870
I will not have this!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.900
No matter what you think...

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:45.510
...and no matter what Shinku says,
I do not care!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.160
This is my order to you 
as your elder twin sister!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:52.150
I forbid you to part ways with me!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.240
Say...

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:57.660
Say something, damn you!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:04.710
So that's your answer, Suiseiseki.

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:07.170
No!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.270
That's everyone's answer!

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.230
Think this through.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.930
This is messed up.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:15.740
Why do sisters that get 
along have to fight?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:19.250
What's the point in becoming 
the ultimate girl?

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.760
Jun!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:24.510
What about you guys is so bad?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.290
What's so unsatisfactory?

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:30.710
Jun-kun.

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:36.300
We are dolls that were 
expected to be perfect.

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:40.820
Rozen Maidens, who aspired
to become Alice and failed.

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:44.570
As a doll...

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:47.240
...I want to fulfill Father's wish.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.140
Farewell, Suiseiseki.

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.700
Souseiseki!

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:56.410
Wait, you!

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.310
Why?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.380
Why?

00:23:42.280 --> 00:23:44.550
Why would Souseiseki do that?

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.790
She has her own thoughts on the matter.

00:23:48.540 --> 00:23:51.140
We cannot gainsay her.

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:54.460
But at this rate, someday
you'll have to go against her...

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:55.930
Yes.

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:57.930
You're okay with that?

00:23:58.410 --> 00:23:59.530
Well...

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:03.070
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:06.520
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 9
The Admonition
